---
layout: base.njk
title: Internships
description: Unpaid student internships at Herbart Kita in writing, editing, book production, and publishing. Remote or hybrid, at least 10 hours a week.
permalink: /internships/
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Student internships</p>
    <h1 class="display display--page">Learn publishing by making books.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Our interns work on the books we publish. You pick a track, work with our editors, and leave with published work you helped make.</p>
    <dl class="tally tally--text">
      <div><dt>Pay</dt><dd>Unpaid</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Where</dt><dd>Remote or hybrid</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Time</dt><dd>10+ hours a week</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-label">Tracks</h2>
    <div class="tracks">
      <article class="track">
        <h3>Editorial</h3>
        <p>Read submissions, write reader reports, and work with authors on revisions.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="track">
        <h3>Copyediting &amp; proofreading</h3>
        <p>Check manuscripts for grammar, consistency, and facts, then read the proofs before print.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="track">
        <h3>Writing</h3>
        <p>Write jacket copy, author bios, and pieces that help each book find readers.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="track">
        <h3>Book production</h3>
        <p>Help lay out interiors, work on covers, and prepare files for Amazon and the printer.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="track">
        <h3>Publishing</h3>
        <p>Set up book listings, plan launches, and track how books reach readers.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="track track--argosy">
        <h3>The Argosy</h3>
        <p>Report and edit for <a href="{{ site.argosyUrl }}">The Argosy</a>, the student newspaper we sponsor.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--tint" id="apply">
  <div class="wrap cta">
    <div>
      <h2 class="cta__title">How to apply</h2>
      {% if site.email %}
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Internship%20application">{{ site.email }}</a> with the track you want, your school year, how many hours a week you can give (10 at minimum), whether you want to work remotely or hybrid, and a short writing sample.</p>
      {% else %}
      <p>Applications open soon. Check back for the address to send your writing sample to.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if site.email %}<a class="btn btn--solid" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Internship%20application">Apply by email</a>{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
